        "title": "Expensivebuff CLI package added for April Fools",
        "summary": "Added `expensivebuff` npm package (v1.0.4) as an April Fools joke. The CLI binary prints an ASCII logo and directs users to the real Codebuff and Freebuff packages. Includes `expensivebuff/cli/release/README.md`, `index.js`, and `package.json`.",
