      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "If you install and run this tool today, your terminal will print a big ASCII art logo for a fake product called Expensivebuff, celebrate April Fools with a toast, and then point you to the real tools Codebuff and Freebuff instead. The developers built it as a joke: it is literally the same code as Codebuff, just rebranded with a pricier name for a day. Nothing functional is added or changed; opening it only shows the prank landing page and the links to the genuine software. The joke package is live now as a one-time April Fools novelty.",
